{"evidence_id": "qe_paper_aqr_factor_2023_001", "evidence_type": "paper_reported", "factor_id": "multi_factor", "claim": "该综述强调评价因子需要同时考虑长期与跨市场证据、经济解释、样本外表现、成本和组合实施，不能仅凭单次显著回测。", "claim_plain": "一个因子值得相信，不是因为一张回测图好看，而是要在不同地方、不同时间经得住验证，并且扣完成本还能落地。", "caveat": "综述汇总多个研究，具体因子结论应与原始论文及官方数据交叉核对。", "source_id": "paper_aqr_factor_2023", "source_title": "Fact, Fiction, and Factor Investing", "source_kind": "peer_reviewed_paper", "source_pages": "3-4, 19-22", "source_url": "", "source_sha256": "14eeaa25656d375d3cc4fd43c09eb6ae994dd92d12f4fadc1ddb539e97606121", "market": "global", "period": "multiple historical samples", "frequency": "paper_defined", "calculation": "review of empirical and implementation literature", "data_version": "local_pdf_sha256:14eeaa25656d375d", "quality": 0.88, "display_policy": {"backend_eligible": true, "frontend_default": "visible"}, "policy_flags": {"no_raw_text": true, "historical_qualifier_required": true, "no_trade_advice": true, "paper_reported_not_recomputed": true, "engine_eligible": true}, "metadata": {"authors": ["Michele Aghassi", "Cliff Asness", "Andrea Frazzini", "Ronen Israel", "Tobias Moskowitz"], "work_id": "aqr_fact_fiction_factor_2023"}}
{"evidence_id": "qe_paper_aqr_momentum_2014_001", "evidence_type": "paper_reported", "factor_id": "momentum", "claim": "该文汇总并检验动量在多市场、多资产和样本外时期的证据，同时讨论空头端、规模与交易成本等常见质疑。", "claim_plain": "动量不是只在一小段美国小盘股历史里出现，但它仍会经历很痛的反转，不能把长期证据当成每期都有效。", "caveat": "该文属于证据综述与再检验；具体数字应回到引用数据版本复算。", "source_id": "paper_aqr_momentum_2014", "source_title": "Fact, Fiction and Momentum Investing", "source_kind": "journal_article", "source_pages": "1-3, 20-24", "source_url": "", "source_sha256": "b725977c8e5a32786359ad0b62efc3f3cd0edcf7f34d1ba9a69d2023ed3852c2", "market": "global", "period": "multiple historical samples", "frequency": "paper_defined", "calculation": "paper synthesis and robustness tests", "data_version": "local_pdf_sha256:b725977c8e5a3278", "quality": 0.88, "display_policy": {"backend_eligible": true, "frontend_default": "visible"}, "policy_flags": {"no_raw_text": true, "historical_qualifier_required": true, "no_trade_advice": true, "paper_reported_not_recomputed": true, "engine_eligible": true}, "metadata": {"authors": ["Clifford S. Asness", "Andrea Frazzini", "Ronen Israel", "Tobias J. Moskowitz"], "work_id": "aqr_fact_fiction_momentum_2014"}}
{"evidence_id": "qe_paper_aqr_value_2015_001", "evidence_type": "paper_reported", "factor_id": "value_pb", "claim": "该文检验价值投资关于集中度、坏公司、因子冗余、长多限制及风险解释的常见说法，并强调价值定义与组合实施的重要性。", "claim_plain": "价值不是随便买便宜公司，也不只适用于少数集中持仓；但为什么会有价值溢价，风险和行为解释都不能被简单排除。", "caveat": "该文为综合检验，结论依赖价值度量和所引用样本；历史结果不预示未来。", "source_id": "paper_aqr_value_2015", "source_title": "Fact, Fiction, and Value Investing", "source_kind": "journal_article", "source_pages": "1-3, 24-28", "source_url": "", "source_sha256": "19eb65c2a62e7aaf307e55ae35efe916b66a277c951b34049070d27a10ab912f", "market": "global", "period": "multiple historical samples", "frequency": "paper_defined", "calculation": "paper synthesis and robustness tests", "data_version": "local_pdf_sha256:19eb65c2a62e7aaf", "quality": 0.88, "display_policy": {"backend_eligible": true, "frontend_default": "visible"}, "policy_flags": {"no_raw_text": true, "historical_qualifier_required": true, "no_trade_advice": true, "paper_reported_not_recomputed": true, "engine_eligible": true}, "metadata": {"authors": ["Clifford S. Asness", "Andrea Frazzini", "Ronen Israel", "Tobias J. Moskowitz"], "work_id": "aqr_fact_fiction_value_2015"}}
{"evidence_id": "qe_paper_carhart_1997_001", "evidence_type": "paper_reported", "factor_id": "momentum", "claim": "该论文在无幸存者偏差的基金样本中发现，基金业绩持续性大部分可由共同因子、费用和一年期收益持续解释，并使用动量因子扩展归因模型。", "claim_plain": "基金过去表现延续，不一定都是经理更聪明；可能是持有了当时有动量的资产，也可能只是费用更低或运气。", "caveat": "研究对象是共同基金业绩归因，不应直接解释为动量策略的未来收益保证。", "source_id": "paper_carhart_1997", "source_title": "On Persistence in Mutual Fund Performance", "source_kind": "peer_reviewed_paper", "source_pages": "1-2", "source_url": "", "source_sha256": "746f959372dee1e878bb318c11bacc5614017d409cb7fdadcb213ccf3c41a8df", "market": "US", "period": "1962 to 1993", "frequency": "paper_defined", "calculation": "paper-reported survivor-bias-free mutual-fund regressions", "data_version": "local_pdf_sha256:746f959372dee1e8", "quality": 0.96, "display_policy": {"backend_eligible": true, "frontend_default": "visible"}, "policy_flags": {"no_raw_text": true, "historical_qualifier_required": true, "no_trade_advice": true, "paper_reported_not_recomputed": true, "engine_eligible": true}, "metadata": {"authors": ["Mark M. Carhart"], "work_id": "carhart_persistence_1997"}}
{"evidence_id": "qe_paper_ff1992_001", "evidence_type": "paper_reported", "factor_id": "value_pb", "claim": "在该论文的美国股票样本中，规模与账面市值比共同刻画了平均收益横截面的主要差异；在控制规模后，账面市值比仍与平均收益相关。", "claim_plain": "在这段美国历史样本里，公司大小和账面价值相对股价的高低，比只看 Beta 更能区分不同股票组的平均表现。", "caveat": "这是特定历史样本和排序方法的结论，不预示未来；后续数据、交易成本和模型设定可能改变结果。", "source_id": "paper_ff1992", "source_title": "The Cross-Section of Expected Stock Returns", "source_kind": "peer_reviewed_paper", "source_pages": "1", "source_url": "", "source_sha256": "e5c7db434697628557d906e1fd2e86cefdc19f341399046f32f4f15bca6a700f", "market": "US", "period": "1963-07 to 1990-12", "frequency": "paper_defined", "calculation": "paper-reported cross-sectional portfolio sorts and regressions", "data_version": "local_pdf_sha256:e5c7db4346976285", "quality": 0.96, "display_policy": {"backend_eligible": true, "frontend_default": "visible"}, "policy_flags": {"no_raw_text": true, "historical_qualifier_required": true, "no_trade_advice": true, "paper_reported_not_recomputed": true, "engine_eligible": true}, "metadata": {"authors": ["Eugene F. Fama", "Kenneth R. French"], "work_id": "ff_cross_section_1992"}}
{"evidence_id": "qe_paper_ff1992_002", "evidence_type": "paper_reported", "factor_id": "size", "claim": "该论文报告，在其样本与控制变量设定下，规模与平均股票收益存在负向横截面关系。", "claim_plain": "在这段历史样本中，小公司组和大公司组的平均表现有系统差别，但这不是说小公司以后一定更好。", "caveat": "微盘股、流动性、退市处理和后续时期稳健性必须另行检验。", "source_id": "paper_ff1992", "source_title": "The Cross-Section of Expected Stock Returns", "source_kind": "peer_reviewed_paper", "source_pages": "1, 10-21", "source_url": "", "source_sha256": "e5c7db434697628557d906e1fd2e86cefdc19f341399046f32f4f15bca6a700f", "market": "US", "period": "1963-07 to 1990-12", "frequency": "paper_defined", "calculation": "paper-reported size sorts and Fama-MacBeth regressions", "data_version": "local_pdf_sha256:e5c7db4346976285", "quality": 0.94, "display_policy": {"backend_eligible": true, "frontend_default": "visible"}, "policy_flags": {"no_raw_text": true, "historical_qualifier_required": true, "no_trade_advice": true, "paper_reported_not_recomputed": true, "engine_eligible": true}, "metadata": {"authors": ["Eugene F. Fama", "Kenneth R. French"], "work_id": "ff_cross_section_1992"}}
{"evidence_id": "qe_paper_ff1993_001", "evidence_type": "paper_reported", "factor_id": "market_risk_premium", "claim": "该论文提出用市场、规模与账面市值比相关组合解释股票收益的共同变动，并以期限与违约相关因子描述债券收益共同变动。", "claim_plain": "作者把股票和债券的共同涨跌拆成几类大因素，用来判断一项收益到底来自哪里。", "caveat": "因子构造、样本市场和估计期间具有特定性，模型解释不等于因果。", "source_id": "paper_ff1993", "source_title": "Common Risk Factors in the Returns on Stocks and Bonds", "source_kind": "peer_reviewed_paper", "source_pages": "1-4", "source_url": "", "source_sha256": "a03081c7d2a8296607f28c84d9fd77db6a10ec5422a857182642bb538fd268ca", "market": "US", "period": "1963 to 1991", "frequency": "paper_defined", "calculation": "paper-reported factor-mimicking portfolio regressions", "data_version": "local_pdf_sha256:a03081c7d2a82966", "quality": 0.96, "display_policy": {"backend_eligible": true, "frontend_default": "visible"}, "policy_flags": {"no_raw_text": true, "historical_qualifier_required": true, "no_trade_advice": true, "paper_reported_not_recomputed": true, "engine_eligible": true}, "metadata": {"authors": ["Eugene F. Fama", "Kenneth R. French"], "work_id": "ff_common_risk_1993"}}
